  unitName: Thrud (EU)
  unitId: 740113
  unitNumber: 7029
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Thrud is the daughter of a
    god of thunder. She only selects the bravest amongst all, and is always the first
    in line in battle.
  summonDesc: I will strike your enemies. They won't stand a chance!
  fusionDesc: Rage is my power. Summoner... anger me...
